# Wazuh SIEM Lab Deployment on DigitalOcean (Ubuntu 22.04)

## Overview

This document explains how to deploy a complete single-node Wazuh SIEM platform on a DigitalOcean Ubuntu Droplet.

The setup includes:

* Wazuh Manager
* Wazuh Indexer
* Wazuh Dashboard
* Filebeat
* HTTPS Dashboard Access
* UFW Firewall Configuration

This lab is suitable for:

* SOC learning
* SIEM practice
* Threat hunting labs
* Home lab environments
* Small production deployments

