# Example Agent Installation (Ubuntu)

## Download Agent

```bash
curl -sO https://packages.wazuh.com/4.x/apt/pool/main/w/wazuh-agent/wazuh-agent_4.8.2-1_amd64.deb
```

## Install Agent

```bash
sudo WAZUH_MANAGER='SERVER_IP' dpkg -i ./wazuh-agent_4.8.2-1_amd64.deb
```

## Start Agent

```bash
sudo systemctl enable wazuh-agent
sudo systemctl start wazuh-agent
```

